ublicity-dipke-on-cockroach-effigy-being-burnt-alongside-ravan-on-dussehra/articleshow/135064666.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-20T13:51:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135065038,imgsize-111744.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Highly inspiring': PM Modi hails Mohan Bhagwat's speech on RSS Sthapana Divas]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/highly-inspiring-pm-modi-hails-mohan-bhagwats-speech-on-rss-sthapana-divas/articleshow/135064575.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135064575.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During the RSS centenary celebrations in Nagpur, Prime Minister Narendra Modi praised Mohan Bhagwat's impactful speech, which underscored important themes of social harmony, national growth, and self-reliance. Bhagwat acknowledged the vital roles of historical figures in fostering spiritual unity among Indians. This celebration, concluding a year of commemorative activities by the RSS, also focused on the importance of self-awareness and the Swadeshi movement for nation-building.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/highly-inspiring-pm-modi-hails-mohan-bhagwats-speech-on-rss-sthapana-divas/articleshow/135064575.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/highly-inspiring-pm-modi-hails-mohan-bhagwats-speech-on-rss-sthapana-divas/articleshow/135064575.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-20T13:39:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135064810,imgsize-96109.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Rural safety net under attack’: Jairam Ramesh calls MGNREGA replacement a ‘surgical strike’]]></title><des