or><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135063307,imgsize-1284369.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Values that inspired Captain Smit Machchhar': RSS chief Mohan Bhagwat cites flydubai pilot in Vijayadashami speech]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/values-that-inspired-captain-smit-machchharrss-chief-mohan-bhagwat-cites-flydubai-pilot-in-vijayadashami-speech/articleshow/135062684.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135062684.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Mohan Bhagwat highlighted Captain Smit Machchhar's bravery during a recent flight incident in his speech. He linked Machchhar's actions to Hindu values that prioritize protecting human lives and safety. The RSS aims to inspire national unity and build a strong society through these traditional values. Bhagwat emphasized the unconditional bond among Indians and the legacy of devotion demonstrated by freedom fighters.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/values-that-inspired-captain-smit-machchharrss-chief-mohan-bhagwat-cites-flydubai-pilot-in-vijayadashami-speech/articleshow/135062684.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/values-that-inspired-captain-smit-machchharrss-chief-mohan-bhagwat-cites-flydubai-pilot-in-vijayadashami-speech/articleshow/135062684.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-20T11:51:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135062776,imgsize-86837.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Vote Chori Ki Raasleela’: Youth Congress burns Ravan effigy with Gyanesh's face - watch]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/vote-chori-ki-raasleela-youth-congress-burns-ravan-effigy-with-gyaneshs-face-watch/articleshow